	(text "NOTES\nShared I2C (TWIM30, P0.01/P0.02, pulls 4.7k -> +3V3):\n    nPM1300 0x6B / BMP581 0x47 / BMA400 0x14 / BMM350 0x15\nGPS I2C (TWIM2x, P1.06/P1.07): MAX-M10S 0x42, pulls -> +3V3_GPS (gated\n    rail, no backfeed when GPS is off)\nSD card: SPIM00 fast SPI 16/32 MHz - SCK P2.06 / MOSI P2.08 / MISO P2.09 /\n    CS P2.10 (Nordic-mandated SPIM00 pins; set P2 extra-high drive E0/E1\n    for 32 MHz). Rail +3V3_SD = BUCK1: OFF at boot, fw enables at 3.3V;\n    tri-state bus before power-off.\nDisplay: source data P2.00-P2.05 (= DK FLPR masks), BCK on P2.07 (moved\n    off P2.06 which SPIM00 SCK needs); gate + COM on P3 (GPIOTE20 ->\n    zero-CPU com-hw wave). VDD1 (3V3) always on; VDD2 (5V boost)\n    EN = P3.09. Power up VDD1 -> VDD2, down VDD2 -> VDD1; COM free-runs\n    whenever the panel is powered.\nLFXO: 32.768k crystal on XL1/XL2 = P1.20/P1.21 (LM20A mapping); NFC pins\n    P1.01/P1.02 left unconnected. Both crystals use internal load caps.\nGPS: power-gated by nPM1300 LDSW2; V_BCKP on +3V3 (32uA backup) ->\n    hot fixes in standby; TX-Ready mapped to TXD (CFG-TXREADY) -> P0.03\nBUCK2 starts 3.3V (VSET2 300k); fw may trim to 3.2V (panel VDD1 abs max\n    3.3V). USB: D+/D- 90R diff pair; ESD on power page."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 28 250 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.4 1.4)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a40f8cfb-144d-44eb-ab83-a45c5279d282")
	)
